        "parms": "# dict.pack and dict.unpack — a dictionary from inlets and back\ndict.pack voice freq gain writes the dictionary voice with one inlet per key: freq on the left, gain on the right. Like pack, the left inlet stores its value and writes, the others only store, so set the right-hand values first. Writing replaces the whole dictionary, then sends its reference.\ndict.unpack voice freq gain is its pair: the reference makes it send each value out of its own outlet, right to left. Unlike Max, a cord carries only the reference dictionary voice, never the dictionary itself, so the first argument names the dictionary.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
